flowchart TD
    InstallStart([生命周期入口]) --> InstallRecovery[执行公共 TransactionManager 恢复；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    InstallRecovery -->|成功；锁保持| InstallCommand[进入当前命令]

    InstallCommand --> InstallDiscovery[执行公共 Agent 刷新流程；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    InstallDiscovery -->|成功；锁保持| InstallTarget{具体目标在快照中，或 all 快照非空?}
    InstallTarget -->|否| InstallTargetFail[打印目标 Agent 未受支持或未安装，或没有已支持且已安装的 Agent] --> InstallPreflightFail
    InstallTarget -->|是| InstallResolve[Cloud List 获取候选；由 lifecycle 解析类型与版本，得到版本已确定的 PowerRef]
    InstallResolve -->|失败| InstallPreflightFail[记录预执行失败；全部目标 Agent 标记 unexecuted] --> InstallPrintFailureSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> InstallBatchError([停止剩余 Agent；释放锁；非零退出])
    InstallResolve -->|成功| InstallNextAgent{按快照顺序还有目标 Agent?}
    InstallNextAgent -->|否| InstallPrintSuccessSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> InstallOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    InstallNextAgent -->|是| InstallAdapter[Resolve 当前 Agent Skill Adapter]
    InstallAdapter -->|失败| InstallFail[记录当前 Agent failed；其余标记 unexecuted]
    InstallAdapter -->|成功| InstallFindManifest[ConfigRepository.Find 查询同类型同名 Power]
    InstallFindManifest -->|失败| InstallFail
    InstallFindManifest -->|成功| InstallSame{已安装目标版本?}
    InstallSame -->|是| InstallSkip[打印相同版本；记录 completed] --> InstallNextAgent
    InstallSame -->|否| InstallFetch[事务外 Cache Fetch；miss 时 Cloud Get 后再次 Fetch]
    InstallFetch -->|失败| InstallFail
    InstallFetch -->|成功| InstallTransaction[调用 TransactionManager.Install；传入旧引用、Adapter 和公共 staging 根]

    subgraph InstallTx[TransactionManager 内部]
        InstallTransaction --> InstallTargetState{事务前 target 状态与旧清单一致?}
        InstallTargetState -->|无旧清单但 target 已存在| InstallTxError
        InstallTargetState -->|有旧清单，或 target 缺失| InstallCreateJournal[创建集中 preparing journal]
        InstallCreateJournal -->|失败| InstallTxError[返回事务错误]
        InstallCreateJournal -->|成功；旧 target 存在| InstallBackup[原子移动旧 target 到同盘 backup]
        InstallCreateJournal -->|成功；首次安装或旧 target 已缺失| InstallPublishing[更新 journal 为 publishing]
        InstallBackup -->|失败| InstallRollbackIntent[更新 journal 为 rolling-back]
        InstallBackup -->|成功| InstallPublishing
        InstallPublishing -->|失败| InstallRollbackIntent
        InstallPublishing -->|成功| InstallPublish[调用 Adapter 适配、复制并原子发布]
        InstallPublish -->|Published=false| InstallRollbackIntent
        InstallRollbackIntent --> InstallRollback[恢复 backup；安全清理事务残留]
        InstallRollback -->|成功| InstallDeleteRolledBack[删除 journal；返回原始错误] --> InstallTxError
        InstallRollback -->|失败| InstallKeepRollback[保留 journal；返回回滚错误] --> InstallTxError
        InstallPublish -->|Published=true| InstallCommitIntent[更新 journal 为 committing]
        InstallCommitIntent -->|阶段更新失败，或 Adapter 同时返回错误| InstallKeepCommit[保留 journal；返回提交后错误] --> InstallTxError
        InstallCommitIntent -->|Adapter 成功| InstallManifest[ConfigRepository.Set 新 PowerRef]
        InstallManifest -->|失败| InstallKeepCommit
        InstallManifest -->|成功| InstallCleanup[删除 backup、重试安全 staging 清理并清理同盘事务目录]
        InstallCleanup -->|失败| InstallKeepCommit
        InstallCleanup -->|成功| InstallDeleteJournal[最后删除集中 journal]
        InstallDeleteJournal -->|失败| InstallKeepCommit
        InstallDeleteJournal -->|成功| InstallTxSuccess[返回成功]
    end

    InstallTxSuccess --> InstallInstalled[打印首次安装、升级或降级成功；记录 completed] --> InstallNextAgent
    InstallTxError --> InstallFail
    InstallFail --> InstallPrintFailureSummary

    InstallFetch -.进程中断；staging 可由下次 Fetch 覆盖.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallCreateJournal -.进程中断；保留集中 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallBackup -.进程中断；保留集中 journal.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallPublish -.进程中断；恢复器结合 publishing 与 target 状态判定方向.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallRollback -.进程中断；rolling-back 固定回滚方向.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallManifest -.进程中断；committing 固定提交方向.-> InstallInterrupted
    InstallCleanup -.进程中断；保留集中 journal.-> InstallInterrupted

    style InstallTx fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
